OL,3,AUS envoy arrives in Russia ahead of
OL,4,Ameeting with Putin as Zelensky says
OL,5,Aintelligence sharing 'works now'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS special envoy Steve Witkoff has
OL,8,Farrived in Russia for his meeting with
OL,9,FPresident Vladimir Putin, where the two
OL,10,Fwill discuss proposals on ending
OL,11,FRussia's years-long conflict with
OL,12,FUkraine.
OL,14,FThe talks come one day after Witkoff's
OL,15,Fmeeting with Ukraine's President
OL,16,FVolodymyr Zelensky in Oslo, which a US
OL,17,Fofficial described as "constructive".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
