OL,3,AUS envoy arrives in Russia ahead of
OL,4,Ameeting with Putin as Zelensky says
OL,5,Aintelligence sharing 'works now'
OL,6,
OL,7,FKyiv previously accused the US of
OL,8,Fwithholding key intelligence - a claim
OL,9,Frejected as "scandalous" by Washington
OL,10,F- but on Tuesday, Zelensky said that
OL,11,Fintelligence sharing with the US on
OL,12,FRussian missile attacks "works now".
OL,14,FZelensky and his European allies said
OL,15,Fit was now up to Russia to respond to
OL,16,Fthe proposals agreed in Oslo when
OL,17,FWitkoff meets Putin in St Petersburg.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
